      "value": "I noticed from october 2025 cloudflare crash, many people that connect to European world have issue with world join leaning the error: \"Behaviour] Lost connection to realtime network while waiting to enter room: Disconnected - initial join - La tua connessione a VRChat è scaduta. Verifica la tua connessione e riprova.\" and it took 5-8 retry to join a world\n\nPlus sometimes i hear the player voice in these world crippling\n\nUsing Cloudflare WARP it help to fix the voice player (still not sure anyway) but don't help with world joining\n\nThere are no issue with other realm, like american or japanese\n\nI am italian and i am using Fastweb ISP",
